GUJ NEFT OUTAWARD DOUBT

GUJ.NEFT.OUT.COPY queue is used as a safety backup checkpoint —
MQOutput puts a message copy before main processing,
MQGet deletes it at the end if everything succeeds,
otherwise, it remains for reprocessing.

Soch jaise:

Tu ek bank transaction kar raha hai.

Pehle bank ek backup slip likh ke side me rakhta hai.

Agar transaction success ho gaya → slip phaad di (delete).

Agar failure aaya → slip se wapas transaction retry karega.